      "start_seconds": 67.58,
      "end_seconds": 92.82,
      "duration_seconds": 25.24,
      "text": "Morning headaches goes along with it you know most of the time well you know as for Morning headaches I honestly can't say when that began it might have been last month or the month before oh and stopping breathing at night that's been about the same five days"
