      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.6,
      "end_seconds": 339.97,
      "duration_seconds": 26.37,
      "text": "you can sit up now so based on the history and the examination I'd lean towards probable obstructive sleep apnoea it could also be an underactive thyroid so we'll keep that open let me repeat that back to make sure you've had loud snoring for one week and no chest pain or falling asleep driving"
    },
