      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.27,
      "end_seconds": 388.44,
      "duration_seconds": 18.17,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a home sleep study for snoring and apnoeas. Avoid alcohol in the evening, lose some weight if you can, and do not drive when drowsy. Please come and see me after the sleep study"
    },
